## GeoNames (attribution required)

The world city list (`app/data/world_cities.tsv.gz`) is built from the GeoNames `cities15000`
data set, and the `zipcodes` package (US ZIP codes) draws on GeoNames data as well. This product
includes data from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The data was filtered
and reformatted for this app. The `zipcodes` package also credits USPS and
unitedstateszipcodes.org.

## Search model (downloaded, not committed)

Search by meaning uses the sentence-transformers `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` model
(https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2), published under the Apache
License 2.0. The install fetches the revision pinned in `app/embedder.py` and checks the SHA-256 of
every file; the model is not stored in this repository. The container image contains a copy.

