## Development tools

Test and build tools (pytest, ruff, mypy, Playwright and others) are used only by contributors,
are not shipped in the install zip or the container image, and are listed in `pyproject.toml`.

## Keeping this file current

A new bundled font, library, outline or data set needs an entry here in the same change.
`tests/test_release_notices.py` fails when an asset under `app/static` or `app/data` has none.
Re-check the Python package table against `uv.lock` before each release.
